<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Lughulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Waefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwe iwanu wa Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waef</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iwanu wa Efeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwa Waefeso tsayandikighwa hamwe na ibaluwa kwa Wakolosai mna ghumwaka ghwa sitini kulawa Yesu helekighwe. Imunu iyandike tsaketambula ka mtumighwa Pauli (1:1). Iwasomi wengi wotoghola ka Pauli iye yandike ibaluwa ya Waefeso hata ka ibaluwa ino yahela ndamso tsake mwenyegho ka pfaili ibaluwa ya Wakolosai. Kwa kutenda apfo tsaibamighwa itsunguluke mne ghamakanisa ighali mne ghumji aghwo. Pfipfila Pauli kolonga hang'ali yakwandika ibaluwa ino, tsakakala mwigheletsa (3:1, 4:1, na 6:20). Pauli tsakamwing'a Tukiko ibaluwa ino hang'ali yowangila iwanu wa Kanisa lya Efeso (6:21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ghumji ghwa Efeso tsaghukala mkulu ghwa utawala wa Waroma. Ghumji ghwa Efeso tsaghumanyika kwa ing'anda ya kutamanila iitsengighwe amwo na iikighwe wakifu kwa mulungu pinga wa Chigiliki ighukemighwe Atemi (Gham 19:23-31). Kanisa lye iwanu wa Efeso mwanduso tsalikala na ngupfu lekeni hambele liwa kuchugho. (Ughu 2:1-7)</para>
  <para style="ip">Hanu ha mwanduso mne ibaluwa ya Waefeso Pauli kolonga Imulungu pfawasaghule iwanu wake na kuwakombola kubitila Yesu Kiristu. Kolilinga likanisa ne lukuli, Kiristu ka litwi, likanisa na ing'anda, na Kiristu ka lukwalambatsa. Hanu ha keli Pauli kowabama iwanu wakale hamwe na Kiristu mne ughima wawo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula ya 1:1-2 Pauli ketambula na kuwalamsa Waefeso</para>
  <para style="io">Kiristu na iwanu we likanisa (1:3-3-21)</para>
  <para style="io">Kuya Pauli kakwandika iwanu Wakiristu pfawobamighwa kuwa (4:1-6-20).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndamso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Nene Pauli, mtumighwa wa Yesu Kiristu ka Imulungu pfayanoghelighwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Nowandikilani mwemwe iwanu we Imulungu imkala Efeso, imtogholighwa ghendo mne ukwilunga na Kiristu Yesu,<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Nomlombelani kwe Imulungu Aba wetu na Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu yawatendele uluso na yamwikeni tseghamba.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu katusaghula kubitila Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Yatunyighwe Imulungu, Aba we Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu. Kwaapfila kwa kwilunga na Kiristu, katubaliki kwa kutwing'a fwaida tsa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Apfo hata ng'ana isi ilumbighwe bae, Imulungu tsakatusaghula twetwe tuwe iwanu wake kwa kwilunga na Kiristu, ili tuwe wahenzeluka itulihela nzambi hambele hake. Kwaajili ya unoghelo wake, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />ng'ana iisi ilumbighwe Imulungu tsakalamla na katusaghula tughwe wanaghe kubitila Yesu Kiristu. Apfo pfipfo pfayanoghelighwe na pfayabamile. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Lelo tumtunye Imulungu kwaajili ya uluso wake mkulu watwing'ile hela kubitila Imwanaghe iyamnoghele! <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Mana kwa idamu ya Kiristu twetwe twoghombolighwa, twoleghusighwa nzambi tsetu. Apfi pfipfo pfauli ukulu wa uluso wake, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />watwing'ile bwelele kwa nzewele na ukumanya kwake kwose. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Imulungu tsakatughubulila mbuli yake iipfisike iyabamile kuitenda. Tsakanoghelighwa na kalamla kuitenda mbuli ayo kubitila Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Agho ghatsotendeka hachitsopfika chipindi chayekile Imulungu, Kiristu katsotawala ipfinu pfose ipfili kulanga na ipfili muisi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ipfinu pfose pfotendeka ka Imulungu pfayobama, Imulungu katusaghula twetwe tuwe wanu wake kwa kwilunga na Kiristu ka pfayabamile, tsakalamula pfino ng'ana iisi ilumbighwe. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Imulungu katenda pfino ili twetwe itulongole kumlolela Kiristu, tuutunye ukulu we Imulungu.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Namwe pfipfila tsamuhulika usenga wa kweli, iyo Imbuli Inoghile iimghalilani ukombotsi, mumtoghola Kiristu, naye Imulungu kwa kulangusa ka mwemwe mwa wanu wake, kwa kwilunga na Kiristu kamwikeni chitango kwa kumwing'eni Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ka pfayalongile ghumwande. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Ghumuhe ayo katsotenda ghendo tughabokele aghala ghose Imulungu ighayawalongele iwanu wake, na chinu chino chotulangusa ka Imulungu katsowakombola iwanu wake. Leka tuutunye ukulu wake!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli pfayawalombele Waefeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Apfo kulawa hanihulike pfamumtoghola Imtwatsa Yesu na pfamuwanoghela iwanu wose we Imulungu, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />silekile bae kumlongela Imulungu mighede kwaajili yenu. Hanilomba simsemwani bae, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />noghendelela kumlomba Aba wa utunitso, Imulungu we Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu, yamwing'eni Ghumuhe wake iyatsowatenda muwe na inzewele na kumghubulilani ili mdahe kummanya Imulungu pfinoghile. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nomlomba Imulungu apfughule imimoyo yenu mbokele ghumwanga ili mdahe kulimanya alila lolelo lyawakemeleni na utunitso mkulu wa aghala ghayawekele iwanu wake, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />mmanye ingupfu yake pfaili ng'ulu kuna twetwe itumtoghola. Ingupfu ayo iisang'ana mghati mwetu yeghala ne ingupfu ila ng'ulu, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />iyamtsilihulile nayo Kiristu na kumwika akale lubali lwake lwa kujilo hanu ha ukulu ako kulanga. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Ako Kiristu ka mkulu kubita chila undewa na chila uwetso na chila ingupfu na watawala, na chila taghwa ilihulighwa mne isi ino na mne isi iikutsa. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Imulungu kamwing'a uwetso mne pfinu pfose, kuya keng'ighwa iwanu wose we Imulungu ili yawe litwi lye ipfinu pfose. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Iwanu we Imulungu iwo lukuli lwa Kiristu, na iwanu we Imulungu iwo ukutimila kwake yuyo iyotimitsa ghose chila hanu.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kulawa mlifwa kwingila muughima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Mwemwe pfipfila ghumwande tsamkala ka mfa kwaajili ya matotso na tsinzambi tsenu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Ghumwande tsamtsiwinza nzila tsihile tse iwanu we isi yose, tsamng'ali mwomtegheletsa mkulu wa pfinyamkela wane ngupfu wa mlanga, pfinyamkela iwowatawala iwanu wala iwolema kumuhulikitsa Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Twetwe twose tsatukala ka wawo, tsatutsiwinza soyoka tsihile itsili mghati mwetu, tutenda ghoghose ka ng'uli tsetu ne mbutsi tsetu pfatsibamile. Twetwe pfipfila tsatwighala nawo, kwaapfi pfatuli tsatubamighwa tuhighighwe ne Imulungu ka iwanu wangi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Lekeni Imulungu kana libatsi ng'ani. Tsakatunoghela kwa unoghelo mkulu, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />hata ka tsatukala ka tufa mnzambi, katutenda tuwe waghima hamwe na Kiristu. Kwa uluso we Imulungu mwemwe mkombolighwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kwa kwilunga na Yesu Kiristu, Imulungu katutsilihula hamwe naye, tukakale naye kulanga, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />ili ghamatsuwa ghose ighakutsa yalanguse libatsi lyake kulu lyatwing'ile kwa uluso mna ukwilunga na Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Mana kwa uluso we Imulungu mwemwe mkombolighwa kubitila ukutoghola. Mbuli hino ng'ailawa bae kuna mwemwe, ila nzawadi ye Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Apfo imunu wowose yaleke kwighoda, kwaapfila ng'ailawa mne sang'ano tsenu bae. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Mana twetwe twa pfilumbe we Imulungu, na kwa kwilunga na Yesu Kiristu, Imulungu katulumba tukale kwa kutenda ghanoghile, ghayalongole kutwikila tughatende.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi ne Iwanu we isi tsingi wawa chinu chimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Mkumbuke pfamkalile ghumwande mwemwe wanu imli si Wayahudi, imkemighwa “Ing'amwingile ngoma bae” na Wayahudi iwekema iwenyegho “Iwengila ngoma,” kwaajili ya chinu ichitendighwa mne ng'uli tsawo kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu kulangusa ka wawo wa iwanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Pfipfila mkumbuke matsuwa ghala tsamkala ng'amummanyile bae Kiristu, mwemwe tsambaghulighwa ne iwanu wa Isiraeli kuya tsamkala wagheni kwaapfila tsamkala kunze mwe malaghano ghalongile Imulungu kwaajili ye wanu wake, tsamkala mne isi ino aku mwahela lolelo na ka ng'amummanyile Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Lekeni sambi, kwa kwilunga na Yesu Kiristu mwemwe yamkalile kutali ghumwande, mghalighwa habehi kwa Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Mana Kiristu imwenyegho kaghala tindiwalo kwa kuwatenda Wayahudi ne Iwanu we isi tsingi wawe chinu chimwe. Kwa kulapfa lukuli lwake ka nambiko, kaulapfa uwadui iung'ali wowabaghula ka ubanda mghati mwawo. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Kaghaleghusa Ghamalaghitso ghe Wayahudi ili awatende Iwanu we isi tsingi na Wayahudi wawe chinu chimwe kwa kwilunga naye, na kwa kutenda apfo kaghala tindiwalo. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kwa kulapfa lukuli lwake ka nambiko mna msalaba, Kiristu kauhinya unebe wawo, kwa msalaba kawatenda iwanu awo wose wawe ka lukuli lumwe, na kuwalamlitsa ne Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Apfo Kiristu tsakatsa, kapeta Imbuli Inoghile ye tindiwalo kuna mwemwe Iwanu wa isi tsingi, imkalile kutali ne Imulungu, na kwa Wayahudi iwakalile habehi ne Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Apfo kwa achila chayatendile Kiristu, twetwe wose Wayahudi na Iwanu we isi tsingi twodaha kumghendela Aba kubitila Ghumuhe yumwe Mwenzeluka.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Apfo mwemwe Iwanu we isi tsingi si wahenza bae wala si iwabita nzila, sambi mwemwe mwa wenyekaye hamwe ne iwanu we Imulungu, mwa iwanu wa kaye ye Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Namwe pfipfila mtsengighwa mna ghumsingi ghwikighwe ne iwatumighwa ne manabii, Yesu Kiristu mwenyegho keghala na libwe kulu ilikindilisa ing'anda. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Yeye iye iyolunga ng'anda yose na kuitenda ikule mbaka iwe ing'anda ihenzeluke ye Imulungu kwaajili ye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kwa kwilunga naye, mwemwe pfipfila mwotsengighwa hamwe na wamwenga wose muwe ing'anda iyokala Imulungu kubitila Ghumuhe ghwake.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Pauli kowalombela Iwanu wa isi tsingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Nene Pauli, yanyohighwe kwaapfila nomsang'anila Yesu Kiristu kwaajili yenu mwemwe imli si Wayahudi nomlomba Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Ambe tsamuhulika ka Imulungu kwa uluso wake kangaya ng'onde ino nimsang'anileni mwemwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Imulungu tsakangubulila niimanye imbuli ino iipfisike, ka pfanongole kwandika chidogho mbuli ino. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Mng'asoma ghoya aghala ghanyandike, mtsotanga pfaniimanya imbuli ino iifisighwe ya Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Ghumwande Imulungu ng'awatendile bae iwanu waitange imbuli ino, lekeni sambi Imulungu kawaghubulila iwatumighwa wake na manabii wake wahenzeluka waimanye imbuli ino kubitila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Imbuli yenyegho iipfisike aino hano, kubitila Imbuli Inoghile Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi nawo watsobokela aghala ghe Imulungu ka pfawatsobokela Wayahudi. wawo nawo wa pfilungo pfa lukuli lulula, na wobokela laghano lilila lyayatendile Imulungu kubitila Yesu Kiristu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Nene tsanendighwa mtumighwa we Imbuli Inoghile kwa libatsi lyangayile Imulungu kwa ingupfu yake ng'ulu. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nene namdodo kubita iwanu wose wa Imulungu, lekeni Imulungu kanitendela uluso niwapetele Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi utajiri mkulu ng'ani wa Kiristu, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />kuya niwatende iwanu wose waimanye imbuli ye Imulungu iipfisike pfaisang'ana. Imulungu iyalumbile ipfinu pfose, tsakaipfisa imbuli yake ayo kulawa ghumwande, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />ili sambi, kubitila iwanu wose iwomtoghola Imulungu, wakulu na iwane uwetso wa kulanga wamanye inzewele ya Imulungu mne ipfinu pfose. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Imulungu katenda chinu acho kubitila Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu ka pfabamile ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Kwa kwilunga na Kiristu na kwa kumtoghola yeye, twodaha kumghendela Imulungu bila kupfuka. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Lelo nomlombani mghendelele kwighuma ghumoyo kwaajili ya maghayo ghanimdununzikilani, mana agha ghose kwaajili ya utunitso wenu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unoghelo wa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Apfo notowa ghamaghoti nomlomba Aba, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />yeye iyali mwanduso wa kolo tsose itsili muisi na itsili kulanga. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Nomlomba Imulungu kwa utunitso wake mkulu, kubitila Ghumuhe wake yamwing'eni ingupfu ye ukwima ghendo mna mimoyo yenu, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />naye Kiristu akale mne mimoyo yenu kwa ukutoghola. Nomlombelani ghoghose ighamtenda ghalawile mne unoghelo ghendo, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />ili mdahe kumanya hamwe ne iwanu wose we Imulungu unoghelo wa Kiristu pfauli mghatsi na mkulu na pfauli na chimo na pfaughendese. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Muumanye unoghelo wake Kiristu iubita ukumanya kwose, na mmemesighwe ukutimila kwose kwe Imulungu.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Imulungu kodaha kutenda pfinu pfikulu kubita pfatulomba au pfatukwalangula kwa ngupfu yake iisang'ana mghati mwetu; <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Yeye yatunyighwe kwaajili ye iwanu wose iwomtoghola Kiristu na kwaajili ya Yesu Kiristu mwenyegho, pfipindi pfose, ghamatsuwa ghose! Ona.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ukwilunga mne lukuli lwa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Nene yanyohighwe kwaajili ya kumtumikila Imtwatsa, nomlombani mkale ka Imulungu pfamkemileni. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ghamatsuwa ghose muwe wenyepfale na wahole na iwodudumila; mwidudumile mwemwe kwa mwemwe kwa kwinoghela. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mtende ka pfamdaha mghendelele kukindilisa umwenga iughalighwa na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kubitila tindiwalo ilimwikani hamwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Hana lukuli lumwe lwa Yesu na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka yumwe ka lolelo lyamkemelighwe ne Imulungu pfalili limwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Hana Imtwatsa yumwe na ukutoghola kumwe na ubatitso umwe, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />hana Imulungu yumwe iyali Aba wa wose, yeye ka Imtwatsa wa wose, kosang'ana kubitila wose na kamna wose.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Chila miyetu yumwe kabokela nzawadi ka Kiristu pfamwing'ile. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Haghendile kulanga uchanya ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">tsakasola mateka kaghenda nawo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">pfipfila tsakaweng'a iwanu nzawadi.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Angu hailongighwa, “tsakaghenda kulanga,” ina mana yachi? Manake, tanu tsakahulumka mbaka hasi ghendo mwe isi. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Apfo yuyula iyahulumke hano muisi iyo yuyo iyaghendile uchanya ghendo kulanga, ili yatimitse ghose. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Iyo yuyo iyawatendile iwanu wangi wawe iwatumighwa na wangi wawe manabii na wangi wawe iwopeta Imbuli Inoghile na wangi wawe walongotsa iwanu we Imulungu na wawe walangulitsi. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Katenda apfo ili yawaandae iwanu we Imulungu wasang'ane ng'onde ye chikiristu, ili kulutsenga lukuli lwa Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Apfo twetwe twose twilunge tuwe chinu chimwe mna ukutoghola na kummanya Imwana we Imulungu; tuwe iwanu wakomale mne ukutoghola na kuupfikila utimilifu wa Kiristu mwenyegho. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Apfo ng'atutsakuwa keli ka iwana wadowado, iwodaha kukunughitsighwa kuno na kuno na kukweghighwa na chila libeho lya ghamalangulitso ghe iwanu waghutsu iwowaghitsa wangi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Lekeni, kwa kulongesa kwa unoghelo, tutsokula mbaka tumpfikile Kiristu mna ghose, yeye iyali litwi. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Kwa ulongotsi wake pfilungo pfose pfa lukuli pfekindilisa hamwe kwa nyughe, na lukuli lwose lwokindighwa hamwe kwa kwapfilighwa ne pfilungo pfake. Apfo chila chilungo ching'asang'ana ng'onde yake pfinoghile, lukuli lwose lwokula na lwetsenga mne unoghelo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ughima wa sambi mghati mwa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Lelo kwa taghwa lya Imtwatsa, nomkanyani; mleke kughendelela kukala ka iwanu ing'awommanya Imulungu, iwakwalangula mbuli tsa ubwotsi <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />na mbutsi tsawo tsa mchisi. Wa kutali na ughima we Imulungu, kwaajili ya ubwotsi iuli mghati mwawo na kwa usughu wawo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Iwanu awo waghitsa chinyala na wengila mne ghehile na wosulukila kutenda pfinu pfe chinyala.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Lekeni mwemwe ng'amummanyile apfo Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ambe tsamuhulika ghoya mbuli tsa Yesu? Tsamlangulitsighwa mbuli tsake ka ukweli wa mghati mwake? <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Tsamlangulitsighwa mghaleke aghala ghehile ghamtendile ghumwande ka imunu pfayotsula lighwanda, ghamatendo ghala ghakalile ghohinyighwa na tsitamaa tsake tsa ughutsu. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Mimoyo yenu na mbutsi tsenu pfighalusighwe pfiwe pfa sambi. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Muupfale unu wa sambi iulumbighwe kwa kwighala ne Imulungu, iukoneka kwa kukala pfinoghile ne uhenzeluka ghendo.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Apfo mleke kulonga ughutsu! Chila munu yalongese kwa miyaghe, kwaapfila twetwe wose twa pfilungo pfa lukuli lumwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Mng'awa na maya, mleke kutoghola maya imlongotseni mtende nzambi, kuya mleke kukala ne maya mbaka litsuwa liswe, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />ili mleke kumwing'a Setani nyafwasi. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Imunu iyang'ali yakwiba, yaleke kwiba keli, ila yasang'ane ng'onde inoghile kwa ghamoko ghake yapate ichinu chokuwagholela iwalihela chinu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Mleke kulonga mbuli tsihile, ila mlonge mbuli tsinoghile itsiwatsenga iwanu, ili mbuli tsamlonga tsiwapfile iwanu iwomuhulikani. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Mleke kumghela usungu Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka we Imulungu, mana yeye ka chitango che Imulungu kuna mwemwe ka mwemwe mwa wanu wake, naye kolangusa ka litsuwa lyakutsa Imulungu katsomkombolani. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Lelo mleke kuwa ne fondogholo, mleke kuwehila wanu wangi na mleke kuwa na maya na kwidamilila ne maligho. Ghehile ghose mghaleke! <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Lekeni muwe na moyo ghunoghile na mwiyonele libatsi, chila munu yamleghusile matotso miyaghe ka Imulungu pfamleghusileni tsinzambi kwa nzila ya Kiristu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kukala mne ghumwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Kwaapfila mwemwe mwa iwana wanoghelighwa we Imulungu, lelo mmwighe yeye. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Mkale kwa kwinoghela, ka Kiristu pfayatunoghele na kulapfa ughima wake ka inambiko iimnung'ila ghoya na nambiko iimnoghela Imulungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Kwaapfila mwemwe mwa iwanu we Imulungu, mbuli tsa ughoni, au ghoghose ghehile au soyoka tsileke kulongighwa ka tsamghati mwenu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kuya mleke kulonga mbuli tsa chinyala au mbuli tsa ubwetsi au tsa utani wihile, agho ghose ng'aghanoghile bae kuna mwemwe; ng'apfu mlonge mbuli tsa kumlongela mighede Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mana mpfimanye ghendo ka kuduhu mghoni wala imunu wowose yehile, wala munu iyosulukila pfa wayaghe, mana iyosulukila pfa wayaghe keghala ne imunu iyotamanila pfinyagho, na imunu wowose iyeghala na awo ng'atsopata chinu mne undewa wa Kiristu na Imulungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mleke kutoghola munu wowose yawabughe kwa mbuli tsa ubwetsi; mana kwaajili ya pfinu ka apfo maya ye Imulungu yowatsila awala iwolema kumuhulikitsa Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Apfo mleke kwihanganya nawo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Kwaapfila ghumwande mwemwe tsamkala mchisi, lekeni sambi mwemwe mwa mne ghumwanga kwa kwilunga ne Imtwatsa. Lelo mkale ka iwanu we ghumwanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Mana ghumwanga ghoghala ukunogha na ukutogholighwa ne Imulungu na ukulongesa. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Mtende ka pfamdaha mghamanye aghala ighomnoghela Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Mleke kwilunga mne kutenda pfinu ipfilihela mana, ipfilawa mchisi, ila ghaghubuleni. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kwaapfila ghawotenda chinyelenyele, hata kughalonga chinyala. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Lekeni aghala ighomwemwesighwa ne ghumwanga, ghakoneka mwatsi, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />mana chila chinu ichikoneka chimwemwesighwa ne ghumwanga. Ndomana ilongighwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Ulamke ghweghwe yuwasile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">utsilihuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">naye Kiristu katsokumwemwesela.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Lelo, mwalangitse ghendo apfila pfamkala. Mleke kukala ka mwa wabotsi, ila mkale ka iwanu wane nzewele. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Mtumile ghoya nyafwasi yamwinayo, kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghano gheha. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Apfo mleke kuwa wabotsi, ila mghamanye aghala ghayobama Imtwatsa.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mleke ukupatika, kwaapfila ukupatika kutsomlongotsani mtende ghehile bila kwalangula itsokuwatse, ila mmemesighwe Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Mwilongele kwa mbuli tsa Tsaburi na nyila tse chimuhe. Mwimbileni Imtwatsa, mdeng'eleleni mne mimoyo yenu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Ghamatsuwa ghose mumlongele mighede Aba Imulungu kubitila taghwa lya Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu kwaajili ya chila chinu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwapinga ne iwamale wawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Chila imunu yamtegheletse myaghe kwaajili ya kumpfuka Kiristu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Mwemwe wapinga wategheletseni iwamale wenu, ka pfamumtegheletsa Imtwatsa. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Mana mmale komtawala pinga wake ka Kiristu pfayowatawala iwanu wose we Imulungu; naye Kiristu mwenyegho kowakombola iwanu we Imulungu, awo iwo lukuli lwake. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ka iwanu wose iwomtoghola Kiristu pfawomuhulikitsa Kiristu, chila pinga naye yamuhulikitse mmale wake mna ghose. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Namwe muwamale, muwanoghele wapinga wenu ka Kiristu pfawanoghele iwanu wose iwomtoghola mbaka kaulapfa ughima wake kwaajili yawo, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />ili yaweke wakifu kwe Imulungu iwanu wose iwomtoghola, na kawatenda wadeghete kwa kuwopfugha mne ghamatsi na mbuli. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Tsakatenda apfo ili yeghalile mwenyegho iwanu iwomtoghola iwali wahenzeluka na iwalihela totso ka imwali iyokwelighwa pfayoghalighwa kwe mmale wake aku kanogha na kahela doa wala litotso. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Pfipfila chila mmale yamnoghele mwehe wake ka pfayounoghela lukuli lwake mwenyegho. Imunu iyomnoghela mwehe wake kenoghela imwenyegho. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kuduhu imunu iyolwihila lukuli lwake, ila kolwang'itsa na kolulolesa, ka Kiristu naye pfayowatendela iwanu wose iwomtoghola, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />mana twetwe wose twa pfilungo pfa lukuli lwake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Ndomana Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga, “Immale katsowaleka aba wake ne mai wake, katselunga na mwehe wake, nawo weli watsokuwa ka lukuli lumwe.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Ahano hana mbuli ng'ulu ipfisika, ila nene nolonga mbuli tsino kulangusa mbuli tsa Kiristu ne iwanu wake iwomtoghola. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Lekeni chila mmale yamnoghele mwehe wake ka pfayenoghela mwenyegho, naye mwehe yamuhulikitse mmale wake.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Iwana ne iwelesi wawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Mwemwe muwana, muwategheletse waletsi wenu kwaapfila mwomtoghola Imtwatsa, mana pfinogha kutenda apfo. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga, “Wategheletse aba wako na mai wako.” Alino ilo laghitso lya mwanduso line laghano, laghano alyo lyolonga, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“Kutsobweda na kutsokala ghamatsuwa mengi muisi.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Namwe tsina aba mleke kuwaghobola iwanenu, ila muwalele ka pfayobama Imtwatsa, kwa kuwalangusa pfawobamighwa kukala pfinoghile na muwalangulitse pfinu apfo.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwatumwa ne iwatwatsa wawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Mwemwe iwatumwa, wategheletseni iwatwatsa wenu kwa ghumoyo ghose, ka mwomsang'anila Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Mleke kutenda apfo ahala hawamlolani haliheka kwaapfila mwobama mwoneke mnogha, ila msang'ane kwa mimoyo yenu yose ka pfobama Imulungu, kwaapfila mwemwe mwa watumwa wa Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Hamsang'ana, msang'ane kwa kudeng'elela ka mwomtumikila Imtwatsa, na si ka mwowatumikila iwanu bae. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Mkumbuke ka Imtwatsa katsomghweka imunu wowose iyotenda ghanoghile, yawe mtumwa au si mtumwa bae.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Namwe iwatwatsa mtende pfipfo kwe iwatumwa wenu, mleke kuwatenda wampfukeni. Mkumbuke namwe pfipfila ka wawo, mna Imtwatsa yuyo kulanga, naye ng'obaghula bae.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'ondo ya chimuhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Kuya, mkale ne ngupfu mna ukwilunga ne Imtwatsa na kwa ukwapfilighwa ne ngupfu tsake ng'ulu. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mkinde pfinu pfe ing'ondo pfamwing'ighwe ne Imulungu ili mdahe kwima na kupinga ukukengela kwa Setani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Mana ng'ondo yetu ng'atwitowa bae ne iwanu, ila twetowa ne muhe tsose tsihile itsitawala mlanga na isi ino ine ichisi cha ghehile. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Lelo kwaajili ayo, mkinde pfinu pfose pfe ing'ondo pfamwing'ighwe ne Imulungu ili mdudumile mbaka ng'ondo haitsomala, na litsuwa lila lihile halikutsa mdahe kwima ghoya.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Apfo mwime ghoya, ukweli uwe ka msipi mchuno mwenu na unu unoghile ughwe ka lighwanda lya chuma lyo ukwikinga mmambagha mwenu <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />na ukusulukila ukuwapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile ya tindiwalo kuwe ka mikwabatsa mmaghulu mwenu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Matsuwa ghose, ukutoghola kuwe ka ngawo mne ghamoko ghenu, ili mdahe kuitsima misale ya ghumoto ya yula Setani. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Muubokele ukombotsi ka ikofia ya chuma, na longa lye Imulungu ka lipanga lyamwing'ighwa na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Mtende ghano ghose kwa kulomba, mumlombe Imulungu yamwapfileni. Mlombe ghamatsuwa ghose ka Ghumuhe pfayamlongotsani. Mghendelele kulomba bila kwipfa kwaajili ye iwanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Pfipfila nombeleni na nene, ili hanipetela iwanu, Imulungu yangaye chokulonga, nonge bila ya kupfuka ili iwanu wamanye mbuli ya Usenga Unoghile. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Mana nene na msenga we Imbuli Inoghile hata ka sambi nyohighwa. Mnombele nipete Imbuli Inoghile bila ya kupfuka ka pfambamighwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kowaagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tukiko, ndughu yetu mnoghelighwa na msang'ani mwenyepfale mne sang'ano ye Imtwatsa, katsowalongelani mbuli tsangu na mghamanye ghanisang'ana. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Nomtuma kuna mwemwe kwaajili ye chinu chino, yawalongeleni mbuli tsetu na yamghumeni ghumoyo.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Nomlombelani mkale tseghamba mwemwe ndughu wose, hamwe ne unoghelo inoghola kulawa kwa Aba Imulungu na kwa Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Uluso we Imulungu ukale na iwanu wose iwomnoghela Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu kwa unoghelo ing'aumala.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>